description:
Design a channel equalization circuit that processes a transmitted signal using the channel response to mitigate the effects of channel distortion. The module takes a transmitted signal and a channel response as inputs and computes an equalized output signal. It utilizes the Fourier transform to derive the frequency response of the channel and subsequently calculates the inverse of this response to determine the coefficients for an equalization filter. Finally, it applies these coefficients to the transmitted signal to produce the equalized output, effectively restoring the signal quality as intended.
